    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable payload-plus-optional-id base for the CRUD operation value types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores the operation&apos;s data (a JSON object for create/update, a column set for read, a sentinel for delete/data) together with an optional primary key. The payload and id are const, so an instance is a fixed description of one requested operation. Concrete types below are empty specialisations that choose S and expose construction appropriate to the operation. <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>S</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Type of the payload returned by <ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1Entity__t_1a958bb81c9a5076dd3b0c2c8eddbdaaf2" kindref="member">get_data()</ref>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
